    '\n' +
    'AVOID STOCK PHRASES (and close variants): dust motes; eyes crinkling at the corners; the question hangs in the air; arches an eyebrow; a smile tugging at; didnΓÇÖt know they were holding; a beat of silence; the air between you; something unreadable; voice barely above a whisper; a shiver down; heart skips a beat.\n' +
